## Common Commands
```bash
# Studio
docker compose up remotion-dev

# Render with composition override
COMPOSITION_ID=TransitionsDemo docker compose up remotion-render

# Build + push image
./scripts/build-and-push.sh v1.1.0

# Local test render
./scripts/test-local.sh TransitionsDemo
```
